                    around clean design and lasting quality.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#featured">Shop featured</a>
                    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#stories">Read the journal</a>
